---
source: crates/krishiv-optimizer/tests/it/rules.rs
expression: "SELECT t.a FROM t JOIN u ON CAST(t.a AS STRING) = u.d WHERE u.d = '5'"
---
Project [a#0]
+- Join Inner, (CAST(a#0 AS STRING) == d#4)
   :- Scan spark_catalog.default.t [a#0]
   +- Filter (d#4 == '5')
      +- Scan spark_catalog.default.u [d#4]
